{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Removes all notifications delivered by your app from the iOS Notification Center.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"This is commonly used when:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User opens the app (clear notifications since they’re viewing content)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User logs out (clear notifications for privacy)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Content is marked as read in-app","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Performing a “mark all as read” action"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only removes notifications from your app; other apps’ notifications are unaffected."}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear notifications on app activation and logout:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationManager {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications when user opens app","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Also reset badge","        UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = 0","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","","    func handleUserLogout() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications for privacy","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear user identity","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(\"\")","    }","","    func markAllAsRead() {","        \/\/ Clear from notification center","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Update backend","        APIClient.shared.markAllNotificationsRead { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear badge","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/clearnotificationcenter"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/clearNotificationCenter"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearNotificationCenter"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearNotificationCenter"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"clearNotificationCenter","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)clearNotificationCenter"},"abstract":[{"text":"Clears all delivered notifications from the notification center.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},